{"synopsis":"Ini adalah dunia di mana makhluk jahat secara bertahap mengamuk Namun makhluk jahat itu kuat mereka semua menghilang setelah rumah sakit jiwa ini dan bahkan tanpa martabat mereka direduksi menjadi bahan dan hewan peliharaan Ini adalah rumah sakit jiwa gunung hijau di mana talenta berlimpah dan orangorang kuat dikelilingi Dalam hal ini Lin Fan yang sakit parah yang membawa sistem berkata Saya jelas bukan pasien mental saya adalah orang normal yang suka berkultivasi Biasanya adalah menyentuh soket memanjat kotak tegangan tinggi hari guntur berdiri di atap ke surga menari metode tongkat","alternative_title":"从精神病院走出的强者","author":"Xinfeng","artist":"Yuewen Manhua, 喵三鱻, 杰克爱猫","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"5feb1809-e90b-486f-956d-4f1bd1f4d0a9","number":"204","chapter":"204","title":"Chapter 204","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"65c5e12d-7b19-4cd0-b79c-b7b356aeb3c7","number":"203","chapter":"203","title":"Chapter 203","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"96dbc365-83ba-4b17-bf79-53a3b66b2d10","number":"202","chapter":"202","title":"Chapter 202","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"e6167d7c-b092-4304-91dd-2e369ff222bb","number":"201","chapter":"201","title":"Chapter 201","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c1b900f2-01be-4bf0-9132-8ddafd8d0514","number":"200","chapter":"200","title":"Chapter 200","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"f5172134-21c1-4186-9b8c-b099b9169a50","number":"199","chapter":"199","title":"Chapter 199","date":"2024-12-02","released":"2024-12-02","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"c61a7901-5aa5-40d5-8bfe-f47fdf5f8389","number":"198","chapter":"198","title":"Chapter 198","date":"2024-11-24","released":"2024-11-24","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"695b27b8-66b6-4ab8-918b-49f79d00c3de","number":"197","chapter":"197","title":"Chapter 197","date":"2024-11-24","released":"2024-11-24","ima